en as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nNote that the option\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\sqrt{xy}={x}^{2}\n$$\n\ncannot be written in standard form since the power of $y$ in the term $\\sqrt{xy}$ is not $1.$ Since the equation cannot be written in standard form, we conclude that it is not a first-order linear ODE.\n\nAll of the other equations can be written in the standard form, and therefore they are first-order linear ODEs."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238027 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "044cebf7-b6eb-5073-914f-3e5cdcd378d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-{x}^{2}y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235824} {:answer/id #uuid "1293cba7-6189-54dd-a4e2-9d074f1761c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+4y={e}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235926} {:answer/id #uuid "1c6627eb-f057-5512-93a3-707f5019b19d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-xy=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236001} {:answer/id #uuid "36c360fa-4dab-5810-9dfe-858ee3bc2211" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)y={x}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236167} {:answer/id #uuid "f5144923-4450-516a-9667-4b819845ded5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)={x}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f5144923-4450-516a-9667-4b819845ded5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)={x}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237363} :answer-field/id #uuid "03be2a12-50de-5c2f-8bc5-2792a7e69520" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237446}